comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T22:32:44.658Z",codex-root,Only this Task will be claimed and moved in progress; the Feature and Plan remain open for terminal delivery tracking.
  "2026-07-25T22:46:14.091Z",codex-root,"Focused implementation gates pass: TypeScript, ESLint, 120/120 docstrings, <=300 source LOC, 3.98 percent duplicated lines with no new media clone, 34 focused tests, and full 1,261-test coverage at exact 4620/4620 statements, 2329/2329 branches, 927/927 functions, and 4251/4251 lines."
  "2026-07-25T23:04:29.818Z",codex-root,"Full pre-PR acceptance is green: release verifier passed dependency audit, TypeScript, ESLint, 100% docstrings, duplication and 300-line gates, ShellCheck, PM strict validation/health, build, 1,261 tests, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, Trivy, full-history secret scan, commit audit, and isolated packed npx plus bunx smoke. Live read-only acceptance passed against the configured instance across six formats, wizard isolation, and honest unsupported media-source search classification; no private values were recorded."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T22:32:44.658Z",codex-root,"Live media tree/search/resolve results must be reduced in-process to counts, booleans, and contract classifications before logs or PM evidence."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T22:32:44.658Z",codex-root,"Home Assistant media search has two scopes: media_player/search_media requires entity_id and optionally paired content type/id, while media_source/search_media accepts a source content id and is newest-development capability."
