body: "Implement only from verified Core contracts and installed dependency types. Use top-level imports, erasable TypeScript, no any, no trivial one-use helpers, no source file above 300 code lines, and no raw live media data in durable evidence. Keep media_source/search_media available for current Core development compatibility even when an older stable server returns unknown_command."
